    "tStartMs": 1095520,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "his work with governments and well at least some \nof those governments are beholden to their people.  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1100160,
    "dDurationMs": 4720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Teal is a German citizen and he is still having \ntrouble with his German drone company because  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1104880,
    "dDurationMs": 5040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the government is uneasy about his political \npositions. This is costing him real money and real  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1109920,
    "dDurationMs": 6720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "opportunities. So why not just shut the [ __ ] up? \nHis life would arguably be a lot easier and his  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1116640,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "business is a lot less scrutinized if he didn't \ngo out of his way to look like a super villain,  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1120960,
    "dDurationMs": 5360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "right? But the boring reality is that he \nhas more money than he will ever spend.  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1126320,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and he seems to genuinely think he can convince \npeople that his ideas have their best interest at  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1130720,
    "dDurationMs": 5280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "heart. To that end and in anticipation of some \npush back, he has also engineered his entire  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1136000,
    "dDurationMs": 6320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "portfolio and life for that matter to be extremely \nrobust. He has multiple citizenships in Germany,  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1142320,
    "dDurationMs": 5680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the United States, and New Zealand. And he also \napplied for a passport in Malta in 2022. He has  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1148000,
    "dDurationMs": 4960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "structured companies specifically incorporated \nand diversified across the planet. and he has  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1152960,
    "dDurationMs": 4240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "an extensive network and friends in \nvery high places. He is also not tied  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1157200,
    "dDurationMs": 4480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to a single business like almost every other \nbillionaire at his level. Someone like Zuck,  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1161680,
    "dDurationMs": 5520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Bezos, Ellison or even Musk are for better or \nworse poster boys for their companies. Most  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1167200,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "people would have no clue what Teal is actually \ninvested in. And even with all of this background,  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1171600,
    "dDurationMs": 5280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "his private holdings are private. So we probably \ndon't know the full extent of where his money is.  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1176880,
    "dDurationMs": 5600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, sure. He is associated with Palanteer, which \nis almost certainly by far his largest asset at a  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1182480,
    "dDurationMs": 5600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "roughly $9 billion stake. But nobody thinks that \nis a nice company. Its value isn't going to drop  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1188080,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because of bad PR. If anything, leaning hard \ninto the school cap baddy bond villain thing  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1192880,
    "dDurationMs": 4160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "kind of cements what the company does to a lot \nof investors, and average people aren't their  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1197040,
    "dDurationMs": 5040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "customers anyway. So, he can get away with saying \nwhatever he wants without the same vulnerabilities  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1202080,
    "dDurationMs": 5120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that other major business leaders have. It just \nso happens that what he wants to say is kind of  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1207200,
    "dDurationMs": 4880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a bit out there. Also, for what it's worth, \nhe probably misses out on a lot of SoCal soy  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1212080,
    "dDurationMs": 5040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "boy founders that believe in nonsense things like \nhumanity's continued existence. But for a lot of  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1217120,
    "dDurationMs": 4960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "founders that want to pursue less PC initiatives \nlike nuclear tech, weapons or big data harvesting,  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1222080,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "he is the first person they will go to. Which \nmeans again to play devil's advocate, saying  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1226480,
    "dDurationMs": 4960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "wild things that makes headlines is good marketing \nfor his core businesses, which is investing money  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1231440,
    "dDurationMs": 5120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "into companies that put returns over traditional \nethics. Now, it is almost impossible to cover this  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1236560,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "guy without simultaneously him and going \ndown a conspiracy rabbit hole at the same  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1241360,
    "dDurationMs": 5200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "time. Obviously, he is not advocating for a future \nwhere regular people come out on top. and he isn't  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1246560,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "really even trying to hide that. But arguably the \nbigger problem is that people with this much money  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1251200,
    "dDurationMs": 4240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "can have so much influence to begin with. Now, if \nyou want to see all of these systems actually put  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1255440,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to work, go and watch this video next to find \nout how money and politics made this a truly  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1259280,
    "dDurationMs": 5040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "unsolvable problem. And don't forget to like and \nsubscribe to keep on learning how money works."
    } ]
  } ]
}
